# CrewRig requires no forge-access credential by default.
#
# Forge access is CLI-only (spec 0090, ADR-0015): authentication is delegated
# to the forge's own command-line tool — `gh` for GitHub, `glab` for GitLab,
# `tea` for Gitea — via each tool's own `auth login`. The framework ships no
# forge MCP server and no forge token, so no forge credential is set here.
# Add your own variables below only if a non-forge integration needs them.
